// `this.ohlcvs[symbol][timeframe]` — printed `getValue(getValue(this.ohlcvs, symbol), timeframe)`.
// Every writer stores `new ArrayCacheByTimestamp`, a SIBLING of ArrayCache (both : BaseCache),
